- Geometric/Design Space: 2D brain domain extracted from rat T2-weighted MRI slice (14,003 FEM degrees of freedom); Time domain T = 10 days with uniform time step Δt = 0.1 (K = 100 time steps); Experimental design space constrained to selecting d = 4 observation times from K = 10 candidate days (t_10, t_20, ..., t_100); Binary design space Ξ = {ξ = (ξ_1, ..., ξ_K) ∈ {0,1}^K : Σξ_k = d}
