- Process/Manufacturing: Clinical constraint that "obtaining daily MRI images over ten days is time-consuming and expensive"; Computational constraint that "the number of PDE solves may be very large when evaluating and optimizing the optimality criterion"; Combinatorial and highly nonconvex optimization of experimental design; Limited to 4 observation time points due to practical clinical constraints
